{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"a18becb9032c345ca6ea73f6f61c69f055bfe86a546fb44ee05dc46c4718aee6","ja":"最後の予想は？","zh":"最后的预测是？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1423282b7a2120e064b9093ca980e2b0b6379fa36bfd4a545731c264e5075e09","ja":"「さあ皆さん！　これが最後です！\n1位に選ばれたお風呂グッズを予想してください！！」","zh":"那么各位！这是最后一项了！请预测获得第1名的浴室用品！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5866c4f8f6efb195d80e8b7f850999d0b5d8c26046fdcef5dcf62806ffde47bc","ja":"これも外れちゃったら、\n杏奈たち、みんな全問不正解になっちゃうよ！","zh":"要是这个也答错了，杏奈她们就会全部题目都答错了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2dd840e9737ed70e843e2edb267e8484af738c2745e142fabf425b3c17c0c446","ja":"そ、そうだよね……。\nでも私、これが一番自信あるんだ！","zh":"对、对啊……。\n不过，我最有自信的就是这个！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c8091afbaf2f96d1c0e552d6aaea274ca9261f1d503b0aad152e28903b759133","ja":"ジャジャーン！\nこの、すっごくいい香りのボディソープ！","zh":"锵锵！\n这个，香味超棒的沐浴露！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1444aa167fba762cc363621a72b4db1a29317e627dff1328aae7a7fb5f36dc71","ja":"あれ、未来も？　杏奈もそれが1位だよ！\nずーっといい香りがして、ハッピーになったから！","zh":"咦，未来也是？杏奈也觉得那个是第1位哦！  \n因为一直都散发着好闻的香气，让人变得好开心！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1eaebeaeca6caf7d529f3dd4f60631a9801ddceb1d6cc032301c1e2c7ab64b82","ja":"おふたりもなんですね。実は私もなんです。\n試してすぐに、購入してしまいました。","zh":"原来两位也是这样啊。其实我也是。\n试了一下，就马上买下来了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"de1ae78e7863d068f7bdf2d565a93f87259de68bfb479c91c1b61913b535b06e","ja":"私も！　香りもですけど、\nお肌もツルツルになって、ビックリしちゃいました♪","zh":"我也是！不仅香气宜人，皮肤也变得光滑了，真让人惊讶♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"750c7a3b04dca54de0e1d11b32018a97d8c51d6aae99331c0ca73bd27a2ed84e","ja":"それじゃあ、杏奈たちのみんなの1位は、\nこのボディーソープで♪　結果発表、お願いしまーす♪","zh":"那么，杏奈她们大家的第1名奖品，就是这款沐浴露♪ 请公布结果——♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"fe3e00080b25df09a41923312252b0111e3ecc3fce047b6f73b9ff8e1fa5c4b9","ja":"「栄えあるみんなが選んだお風呂グッズ第1位は……\nなんと、ボディソープでした！　大正解！！」","zh":"大家选出的浴室用品中，荣获第1名的是……\n居然是沐浴露！完全正确！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"c2ceb71eeb2b7ca6794fa8ec37442b63e40f188684fab648ee99b635777a7f62","ja":"やったー！\n最後の最後に、みんなで正解できちゃったね♪","zh":"太好了！\n最后关头，大家一起答对了呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c6f2815a9c53be7a97ad6e5190bd3ec1e81b484b5e77704c2db8f6eae761fa84","ja":"うん♪　すっごく嬉しい♪","zh":"嗯♪特别开心♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"2e42a76df675ce75af3568a31e5af5dbe9e2bae3c04f02c7485d1963cceb2188","ja":"でも、本当に難しかったね。杏奈、こんなにたくさん\nお風呂グッズがあるなんて、知らなかった！","zh":"不过，真的好难啊。没想到杏奈居然有这么多洗澡用品！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"e88ed4322a7efb2b24ce91ab784d0a0875930eb999d524da3d7a6289de661092","ja":"うん。でも楽しすぎて、他のグッズも\nいろいろ試してみたくなっちゃったよ！","zh":"嗯。不过实在太有意思了，让我也想试试其他各种周边！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"6caf4de5e31b84f7fe95fedc1670a2c08fb377f49c95b3536cc5a2f9fa501b71","ja":"それなら杏奈、みんなでいろんなグッズを試す\nお泊り会をしたいな！","zh":"那样的话，杏奈想和大家一起试试各种周边，办一场留宿会！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"a8ed75973dc0f4b2bfc357dda1778c011ed7b6b6a97998ccf1f12323e0088ff1","ja":"わぁ～、いいね！　やりたい！","zh":"哇～，真不错！我想做！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"1c7d2bd31b73ab8363acdb44e6b095ad1fa4e460af4d5c1903855b1c15694a5c","ja":"そうですね、みんなと一緒なら、\nたくさん試せそうですし、とても楽しそうです。","zh":"是啊，如果和大家一起，就能尝试很多东西，感觉会非常开心。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1806.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"a6f0a2cfa7ac081a29fe11c982d26c579956e2b0d4eb0f5b6b7bc3d46a972504","ja":"わ～い！　みんなでお泊り～♪\nお風呂でまったり～♪","zh":"哇～！大家一起过夜～♪\n在浴室里悠闲放松～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
